# Exclude activitytable from HTML validity checks (ESLint and the Mustache checks
# still run, and every other template here stays fully validated).
#
# It is a page fragment, not a standalone document: its checkboxes carry
# form="tool_bass_settings", which points at the settings form rendered
# after it on the page (see classes/local/bulk_form.php). The linter
# renders the template on its own, where no such form exists, so the HTML
# validator always reports "The form attribute must refer to a form element"
# for markup that is correct on the real page.
activitytable.mustache
